    attack this card, if able.\r\n\u25CF At the end of your opponent's turn, if this
    card did not battle, you win the Duel.\r\nWhen an opponent's monster declares
    an attack: You can detach 1 material from this card; negate the attack, and if
    you do, gain LP equal to that monster's ATK."
